# Lab runner jobs need root: rootful podman (kind, the seed registry on port 443),
# bootc-image-builder, firewall-cmd. So a job can do anything on this VM. That is why the
# VM runs nothing else, its runner takes only jobs from the default branch (the
# job-started hook), and it is cleaned before every job. See images/lab-runner/README.md.
dciab-runner ALL=(ALL) NOPASSWD: ALL
